sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Checkout
  participant Pay as Payment service
  participant Provider as PayMongo mode
  participant Hook as Webhook handler
  participant Recon as Reconciliation
  UI->>Pay: Authorized booking/payment request
  Pay->>Pay: Validate state, amount, currency, mode
  Pay->>Provider: Provider request only when authorized
  Provider-->>Hook: Signed event
  Hook->>Hook: Verify signature and idempotency
  Hook->>Recon: Record provider evidence
  Recon->>Recon: Compare booking, payment, gateway, ledger
  Recon-->>UI: Sanitized reconciled / mismatch state
  Note over UI,Recon: PHASE19_COMPLETE_NO_GO_FROZEN<br/>Live activation not authorized
